## Changes Made
### Frontend (UI)
- Modified [public/app.js](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/Sync_Slack_Discord_ClickUp_Drive/public/app.js) to include the `client\u2192studio` direction in the Drive Sync Config modal's dropdown menu.

### Backend (Logic)
- Modified [src/drive/sync.js](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/Sync_Slack_Discord_ClickUp_Drive/src/drive/sync.js) to parse the new direction options during [runDriveSync()](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/Sync_Slack_Discord_ClickUp_Drive/src/drive/sync.js#129-202).
- Implemented logic that executes the correct order of sync based on `Sync_Direction`:
  - `studio\u2192client`: Syncs from Studio Folder to Client Folder.
  - `client\u2192studio`: Syncs from Client Folder to Studio Folder.
  - `bidirectional`: Syncs in both directions sequentially.
- **Fixed the ping-pong bug**: We fetch `md5Checksum` for files via the Google Drive API and compare them. Before updating an "older" file in the destination, the code checks if the `md5Checksum` matches. If they match, it skips the update to prevent infinite loops of copying the same file back and forth during bidirectional syncs.
- Updated logging formats in [runDriveSync](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/Sync_Slack_Discord_ClickUp_Drive/src/drive/sync.js#129-202) to dynamically reflect "Copied X files to Client Folder" or "...to Studio Folder".

